# KT-50 — trích pha IPI từ boot thật của lần chạy 300 boot sạch (NBOOT=50, matrix 1/2/4)
# Nguồn: /tmp/k3-ktest-main-smp<N>-1.log (boot 1 mỗi cấu hình), chép nguyên văn dòng log, không sửa số.

===== -smp 1 =====
# ipi: harts=1 boot=0 peer=-1 mode=self-ipi target=100 sie_ok=0x1 setup_ok=1
# ipi delivered: mode=self-ipi target=100 sent=100 delivered=0 traps=100 coalesced=0 spurious=0 kinds=0/0/0 timeout=0
# ipi phase1 wait_ticks=0
ok 20 - 100 ipi traps (self)
# ipi drain: mode=self-wait mutual=0 boot_ok=0 peer_ok=0 traps_delta=0/0 wait_ticks=0/0 timeout_ended=1 timeout_wait=500023 timeout_drains=9413
ok 21 - ipi drain khi cho ack
# ipi self: ok=0x1 local=1 sent_delta=0 traps_delta=0 kinds_tlb=2
ok 22 - self-target khong gui
# ipi coalesce: mode=mailbox posts=6 coalesced=4 sent_delta=0 pending=0x3 peer_bits=0x3 peer_delivered=2 ok=1
ok 23 - coalesce khong mat kind
# ipi distinct: ipi_traps=100 interrupts_delta=100 timer_delta=0 plic_delta=0 last_scause=0x8000000000000001 last_code=1 decode_ok=1 ok=1
ok 24 - ipi khong nham timer/external
ok 25 - trap nested panic

